<title>UK: UK seeks opinions on Scottish Radio deal.</title>
<headline>UK seeks opinions on Scottish Radio deal.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Britain's Office of Fair Trading said it is considering whether Scottish Radio Holdings Plc's proposal to buy Community Radio Services Plc needs investigating for competition purposes.</p>
<p>Scottish Radio announced plans to buy Community Radio, better known as Downtown Radio in Northern Ireland, on Monday for 9.7 million stg.</p>
<p>The OFT said it was inviting interested parties to comment by September 19.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717 REU</p>
